OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost 5,000 evacuated in City of
OL,4,ALondon gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 4,700 people have been evacuated
OL,7,Fin the City of London after a gas leak.
OL,9,FThe London Fire Brigade said it was
OL,10,Fcalled at about 10:55 BST to Old Broad
OL,11,FStreet, where crews found a ruptured
OL,12,Fsix-inch gas main at a six-storey
OL,13,Foffice building.
OL,15,FA 200m cordon has been established
OL,16,Fbetween Threadneedle Street and London
OL,17,FWall, with nearby buildings evacuated
OL,18,Fas a precaution.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
